// 004.7: a binder over an unrestricted, non-derived, closed `Money`, `Quantity`, `Duration`, or
// built-in `int`/`string` carrier type ranges over held instances of that type itself, of which
// none are asserted (CHR040).
//! expect-warning: CHR040
Fact person Identified by Helen, Marcus
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Fact unrecorded Identified by person * usd.
+unrecorded(Marcus, 100).
?(Exists unrecorded: unrecorded).
?Not(Exists person, usd: unrecorded(person, usd)).
